{"id":"predlog","lemma":"предлог","pos":"noun","rank":4711,"glosses":["pretext, excuse, pretense","preposition"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a9/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"предлога","plural":"предлоги"},"examples":[{"text":"Я начинаю думать, что это просто предлог.","en":"I'm starting to think it's just a pretext.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to begin, to start","l":"начинать"},{"g":"to think"},null,null,{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"why"]]},{"text":"Это всего лишь предлог.","en":"That's just an excuse.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"only, no more than"]]},{"text":"Он придумал предлог для драки со мной.","en":"He made up a pretext for a fight with me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to make up","l":"придумать"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"scuffle, fight, tussle","l":"драка"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"I","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Вы просто ищете предлог, чтобы от меня избавиться.","en":"You're just looking for a pretext to get rid of me.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"to look for, to seek","l":"искать"},null,{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"from"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"to get rid of"}]},{"text":"Это просто предлог!","en":"That's just an excuse.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},null]}]}